  "ingredients": [
    "1.25 cups all-purpose flour",
    "1 tablespoon white sugar",
    "1.25 teaspoons baking powder",
    "0.25 teaspoon ground cinnamon",
    "1 cup milk",
    "0.25 cup butter, melted",
    "1 large egg",
    "1 cup shredded tart apple"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/rWy2P3_yA_gtRY6BNTouzGaDvXI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/23095-apple-pancakes-VAT-step-01-080ee3db9d3044d4821b0018b079fd80.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/23095/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sift flour, sugar, baking powder, and cinnamon together in a large bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/83cbcEi3wwsvk6WpDTCl5yNPnjw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/23095-apple-pancakes-VAT-step-02-bd0a6b899adf4157965efec4a7c79f04.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/23095/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make a well in the center and add milk, melted butter, and egg; mix until smooth. Stir grated apple into pancake batter until just combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/1OC_CVmthdJ9YSmQKszSaJVYFQg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/23095-apple-pancakes-VAT-step-03-d7d46bf2c0f54d439ccc643037d79356.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/23095/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat a lightly oiled griddle or frying pan over medium-high heat. Pour or scoop the batter onto the griddle, using approximately 1/4 cup for each pancake; cook until bubbles form and the edges are dry, about 2 to 3 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/DS9iXaMkok1FOs5Oysbf0E9wQX8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/23095-apple-pancakes-VAT-step-04-017e324dd929404ebb19fb896a87e9d7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/23095/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Flip and cook until browned on the other side. Repeat with remaining pancake batter.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/tbq9_5IlX_uHUoaSBIx_kIxSVtM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/23095-apple-pancakes-VAT-step-05-381d8916e6404c49a5942b6fef3ac321.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/23095/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/3ZHN05T2Sd_ttR0ptt02rPJBRvg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/23095-apple-pancakes-VAT-step-06-57fa1f06c27e433fa81f248410d02fa7.jpg"
